<title>USA: Musicland Stores Corp Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Musicland Stores Corp Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	   Nine Months</p>
<p>			    1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Sales		   $366,634   $357,585 $1,122,614 $1,035,665</p>
<p> Cost of sales	  238,932    226,268    738,497    658,732</p>
<p> SG&amp;A expenses	  136,714    124,359    412,017    362,779</p>
<p>Operating income (loss) before</p>
<p>depreciation, amortization and</p>
<p> restructure charge    (9,012)     6,958   (27,900)     14,154</p>
<p> Depreciation/amort    11,102     11,778     33,836     33,940</p>
<p> Restructuring charge	--	   --     35,000	   --</p>
<p> Goodwill write-down	 --    138,000	   --    138,000</p>
<p> Operating (loss)     (20,114)  (142,820)   (96,736) (157,786)</p>
<p> Interest expense	 8,800	7,898     23,834     19,815</p>
<p> (Loss) before taxes  (28,914)  (150,718)  (120,570) (177,601)</p>
<p> Income taxes	   (12,850)    (6,168)   (45,400)  (19,206)</p>
<p> Net (loss)	     (16,064)  (144,550)   (75,170) (158,395)</p>
